@startuml
' The tidy version of closing: write, then wait. On a slow minute the
' page is false. Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-tidy-close-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> S : POST the signed close
S -> C : send the close
S -> D : $wrong("delete sessions and grants")
S -> C : ask about the close,\nup to 6 times, 2 s apart
... the chain is slow ...
S --> B : $wrong("the meter is closed")

note over B, C
  If the close never lands, the meter stays open,
  and the site can still draw on the reader's
  fund. The page says the opposite,
  and the reader has no reason to check it.
end note
@enduml
